ring, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213130,"global_rank":257873,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41341},{"name":"bricegnichols/muir","owner":"bricegnichols","html_url":"https://github.com/bricegnichols/muir","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"gear optimization","topics":[],"score":213128,"global_rank":257879,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41342},{"name":"ahmedhamdy2121/Deep-Learning-Neural-Network","owner":"ahmedhamdy2121","html_url":"https://github.com/ahmedhamdy2121/Deep-Learning-Neural-Network","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My tests on the neural network and deep learning in Python","topics":["deep-learning","keras","neural-network","python","tensorflow"],"score":213128,"global_rank":257889,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41343},{"name":"lakshadvani/FaultToleranceRaft","owner":"lakshadvani","html_url":"https://github.com/lakshadvani/FaultToleranceRaft","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This is a Fault Tolerance Experiment using Raft","topics":[],"score":213128,"global_rank":257898,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41344},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauri